    "body": "### Problem\n\nWith multicursors, `d_` deletes everything\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nnvim --clean\n\n```\npizza |pasta\ncat |dog\n```\nwhere `|` are cursors added with Q.\n\npress `d_` \n\nboth lines disappear (same with follow mode enabled).\n\n### Expected behavior\n\nThe expected result should be\n\n```\n|pasta\n|dog\n```\n\n### Nvim version (nvim -v)\n\nNVIM v0.13.0-dev-1644+gaed60b8a53\n\n### Vim (not Nvim) behaves the same?\n\nnot applicable\n\n### Operating system/version\n\nWSL\n\n### Terminal name/version\n\nwezterm\n\n### $TERM environment variable\n\ndoesn't matter\n\n### Installation\n\nfrom repo",
